---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<section class="border-y border-outline-variant/30 bg-surface-container-low py-20 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6 md:px-margin-desktop">
    <div class="mb-12 grid grid-cols-1 items-end gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16 reveal">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-px w-10 bg-secondary"></span>
          <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-secondary">Formación en la fe</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-primary md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Catequesis<br />
          <span class="italic font-medium text-secondary">y formación</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:pb-2">
        <p class="font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant lg:text-lg">
          Inscríbete a los procesos de catequesis o consulta el calendario de preparación para el sacramento del Matrimonio.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-primary p-8 text-on-primary shadow-lg md:p-10 reveal">
        <div class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-40 w-40 rounded-full border border-on-primary/10"></div>
        <div class="absolute -right-2 top-4 h-24 w-24 rounded-full border border-on-primary/10"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col">
          <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-on-primary/25 text-secondary-fixed">
              <Icon name="lucide:book-open-check" class="h-7 w-7" />
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed px-3 py-1 font-label text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-on-secondary-fixed">Inscripciones</span>
          </div>

          <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary-fixed">Procesos disponibles</span>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-primary-fixed">Inscripciones de Catequesis</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-primary/80 md:text-base">
            Catequesis para adultos, Primera Comunión y Confirmación. Completa el formulario en línea y la parroquia dará seguimiento a tu inscripción.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="rounded-full border border-on-primary/20 px-3 py-1.5 font-body text-xs text-primary-fixed">Adultos +18</span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-on-primary/20 px-3 py-1.5 font-body text-xs text-primary-fixed">Primera Comunión</span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-on-primary/20 px-3 py-1.5 font-body text-xs text-primary-fixed">Confirmación +15</span>
          </div>

          <a href="/catequesis" class="mt-10 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-3.5 font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary transition-all group-hover:gap-4">
            Ver inscripciones
            <Icon name="lucide:arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-xl md:p-10 reveal stagger-1">
        <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed/30 text-secondary">
            <Icon name="lucide:calendar-days" class="h-7 w-7" />
          </div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed/30 px-3 py-1 font-label text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-secondary">Próxima jornada</span>
        </div>

        <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary">Catequesis Matrimonial 2026</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-primary">Preparación al Matrimonio</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant md:text-base">
          Consulta el programa anual de preparación para parejas que desean recibir el sacramento del Matrimonio.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-7 rounded-xl border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary-fixed/15 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-secondary text-on-secondary">
              <Icon name="lucide:calendar-check-2" class="h-5 w-5" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-label text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-secondary">Cuarta catequesis</p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-bold text-primary">14–15 y 21–22 de noviembre</p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-body text-xs leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">Sábados 2:00 PM–5:00 PM · Domingos 9:00 AM–1:00 PM</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/catequesis/matrimonio" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary transition-colors hover:text-secondary">
          Ver calendario completo
          <Icon name="lucide:arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" />
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
